Subject: [P23] winedmo: interrupt a stalled read on seek and reopen the transport

P21/P22 serialized an ordinary seek behind the in-flight demux read, as GE
does, so a seek during a stalled read waited for that read (measured 10.1 s,
P19b2 0.16 s). Restore P19b2's interrupt-on-seek. Any failure or EOF of a
read we deliberately cancelled on the direct progressive HTTP path is a
cancellation, never a terminal error or EOS; the seek clears the AVIO
error/eof state. MOV defers the Range reopen to its first post-seek read and
FFmpeg may short-seek forward on the old connection, which a cancelled TLS
read can leave broken (EIO): force that first read to use the underlying
seek (pb->direct), i.e. a fresh HTTP request. Private HTTPS item 25 s/8 s:
6/6 pass (diagnostic build without the fresh request: 1/6).

---
diff --git a/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c b/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
--- a/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
+++ b/dlls/winedmo/media_source.c
@@ -1311,29 +1311,29 @@
         }
 
         WARN("MF media source seek to %s.\n", debugstr_time(position->hVal.QuadPart));
-        /* Do not interrupt a transport which the seek must reuse. Keep the
-         * source lock free while waiting for the old bounded read, so Shutdown
-         * can still cancel it. The counted callback owns the pending seek. */
-        source->demux_seek_pending = true;
-        LeaveCriticalSection(&source->cs);
-        EnterCriticalSection(&source->demuxer_cs);
-        EnterCriticalSection(&source->cs);
-        if (FAILED(seek_error = media_source_get_demux_error(source)))
-            status = STATUS_SUCCESS;
-        else if (source->state == SOURCE_SHUTDOWN || source->demux_thread_shutdown)
-            status = STATUS_CANCELLED;
-        else
+        if (!(status = winedmo_demuxer_set_cancelled(source->demuxer, TRUE)))
         {
-            LeaveCriticalSection(&source->cs);
-            status = winedmo_demuxer_seek(source->demuxer, position->hVal.QuadPart);
-            EnterCriticalSection(&source->cs);
-            if (!status && (source->state == SOURCE_SHUTDOWN
-                    || source->demux_thread_shutdown))
-                status = STATUS_CANCELLED;
+            EnterCriticalSection(&source->demuxer_cs);
+            if (FAILED(seek_error = media_source_get_demux_error(source)))
+                status = STATUS_SUCCESS;
+            else if (!(status = winedmo_demuxer_set_cancelled(source->demuxer, FALSE)))
+            {
+                /* Let Shutdown acquire source->cs and trip the demuxer's
+                 * interrupt callback while a direct network seek is blocked.
+                 * The pending work-item count keeps this source alive, while
+                 * demux_seek_pending keeps other source commands serialized. */
+                source->demux_seek_pending = true;
+                LeaveCriticalSection(&source->cs);
+                status = winedmo_demuxer_seek(source->demuxer, position->hVal.QuadPart);
+                EnterCriticalSection(&source->cs);
+                source->demux_seek_pending = false;
+                WakeAllConditionVariable(&source->work_cv);
+                if (!status && (source->state == SOURCE_SHUTDOWN
+                        || source->demux_thread_shutdown))
+                    status = STATUS_CANCELLED;
+            }
+            LeaveCriticalSection(&source->demuxer_cs);
         }
-        source->demux_seek_pending = false;
-        WakeAllConditionVariable(&source->work_cv);
-        LeaveCriticalSection(&source->demuxer_cs);
 
         if (FAILED(seek_error) || status)
         {
